OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers urged to vaccinate as
OL,4,Abluetongue spreads
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers across the South East must
OL,7,Fvaccinate their animals against the
OL,8,Fpotentially fatal bluetongue "as soon
OL,9,Fas possible", the National Farmers'
OL,10,FUnion (NFU) has said.
OL,12,FAccording to government figures
OL,13,Fpublished on Thursday,, external there
OL,14,Fhave now been 517 cases of the virus in
OL,15,Fthe UK so far this year, including 496
OL,16,Fin England.
OL,18,FThe BBC has reported on cases found in
OL,19,FScotland and the South West, and the
OL,20,FNFU has made clear its concerns for the
OL,21,FSouth East.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
