OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers urged to vaccinate as
OL,4,Abluetongue spreads
OL,5,
OL,6,FLivestock board chair for the East of
OL,7,FEngland Hugh Broom said: "If your
OL,8,Fanimals are not vaccinated already,
OL,9,Fplease speak to your vet about getting
OL,10,Fon the list...it could just take a
OL,11,Fwesterly wind to send the disease our
OL,12,Fway."
